  "boxes": [
    {
      "type": "anchorbox",
      "title": "The Ultimate Team Player",
      "description": "When his teammate fell in battle, Hanuman didn't hesitate; he crossed continents overnight and worked tirelessly to bring the life-saving cure (Sanjeevani). He teaches us the absolute importance of resourcefulness, reliability, and showing up unconditionally for our friends in their darkest hours.",
      "motivating_text": "",
      "citation": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "gotchabox",
      "items": [
        "Phonetic Shifts: रघुवीर (Raghuveera) hardens into रघुबीर (Raghubeera). The Sanskrit `jñ/ñj` cluster in सञ्जीवनी (Sanjeevani) simplifies into the pure Awadhi सजीवन (Sajeevan)."
      ]
    }
  ]
